Issue at 3:20
operator '+' cannot be declared over a bare type parameter - the language already spells a meaning for '+' over the primitives a parameter may be bound to. Declare it for the type itself, e.g. 'operator (Vec<T> $a) + (Vec<T> $b)'.
Begin: '+'
End: '+'
